1
00:00:01,559 --> 00:00:03,080
[♪♪]

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,800
I'm Peppa Pig.

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,920
This is my little brother,
George.

4
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:08,119
[SNORTS]

5
00:00:08,119 --> 00:00:10,479
This is Mommy Pig.
[SNORTS]

6
00:00:10,479 --> 00:00:11,879
And this is Daddy Pig.

7
00:00:11,879 --> 00:00:13,320
[SNORTS]
[ALL LAUGH]

8
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:14,680
Peppa Pig.

9
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:15,920
[GRUNTS]

10
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:17,279
[BIRDS CHIRPING]

11
00:00:17,279 --> 00:00:19,320
[♪♪]

12
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:22,919
[PEPPA READING ONSCREEN TEXT]

13
00:00:24,599 --> 00:00:27,320
[LAUGHING, SNORTING]

14
00:00:29,520 --> 00:00:32,640
NARRATOR:
Peppa and George are playing
hide-and-seek.

15
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:34,680
It is George's turn to hide.

16
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:36,720
He must quickly
find somewhere to hide

17
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:38,680
before Peppa
finishes counting.

18
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:42,360
One, two, three...

19
00:00:43,519 --> 00:00:45,879
four, five,

20
00:00:45,879 --> 00:00:47,960
six, seven...

21
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:49,519
[GIGGLES]

22
00:00:49,519 --> 00:00:52,120
George has found somewhere
to hide just in time.

23
00:00:52,120 --> 00:00:53,800
...10.
[SNORTS]

24
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:56,160
Ready or not,
here I come.

25
00:00:56,160 --> 00:00:59,279
Peppa has to find
where George is hiding.

26
00:01:02,040 --> 00:01:04,080
[SNORTS]
Found you.

27
00:01:04,080 --> 00:01:05,640
Peppa has found George.

28
00:01:05,640 --> 00:01:08,520
George, I could
see you too easily.

29
00:01:08,520 --> 00:01:10,160
[SNORTS]

30
00:01:10,160 --> 00:01:12,080
Now it is Peppa's turn
to hide.

31
00:01:12,080 --> 00:01:15,960
One...um...three.

32
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:17,720
I'll help George
to count.

33
00:01:17,720 --> 00:01:18,960
[SNORTS]

34
00:01:18,960 --> 00:01:23,280
One, two, three...

35
00:01:24,320 --> 00:01:27,479
four, five...

36
00:01:28,399 --> 00:01:32,200
six, seven,

37
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:34,200
eight,

38
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:37,360
nine, 10.

39
00:01:37,360 --> 00:01:40,600
Okay, George,
open your eyes.

40
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:42,720
[SNORTS]

41
00:01:42,720 --> 00:01:45,119
George has to find
where Peppa is hiding.

42
00:01:46,240 --> 00:01:47,880
Oh.

43
00:01:47,880 --> 00:01:50,720
Peppa isn't hiding
under the table.

44
00:01:50,720 --> 00:01:51,880
[SNORTS]

45
00:01:51,880 --> 00:01:53,440
DADDY PIG:
George.

46
00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:55,960
Have you thought
of looking upstairs?

47
00:01:56,839 --> 00:01:59,960
[♪♪]

48
00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:04,240
[GIGGLES]

49
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:10,840
Peppa isn't under the bed.

50
00:02:12,640 --> 00:02:14,040
[SNORTS]

51
00:02:14,040 --> 00:02:16,720
What was that
strange noise?

52
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:23,680
Peppa isn't behind
the curtain.

53
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:25,280
[SNORTS]

54
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:28,560
There is that strange noise
again.

55
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:30,160
What can it be?

56
00:02:30,160 --> 00:02:32,280
[GIGGLING]

57
00:02:35,640 --> 00:02:36,880
Whee!

58
00:02:36,880 --> 00:02:38,880
[BLOWS RASPBERRY, SNORTS]

59
00:02:38,880 --> 00:02:41,359
George has found
where Peppa was hiding.

60
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:47,320
George found me.

61
00:02:47,320 --> 00:02:50,400
Now it is Daddy's turn
to hide.

62
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:52,720
I think George should have
another turn.

63
00:02:52,720 --> 00:02:54,200
[SNORTS]

64
00:02:54,200 --> 00:02:57,400
But George isn't
very good at hiding.

65
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:59,400
I'm sure he'll be better
this time.

66
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:02,200
Close your eyes
and start counting.

67
00:03:02,200 --> 00:03:06,000
One, two, three, four...

68
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:09,519
Oh, dear.
Peppa will easily find George.

69
00:03:09,519 --> 00:03:11,320
...five...

70
00:03:11,320 --> 00:03:14,480
George, come over here.

71
00:03:14,480 --> 00:03:16,519
PEPPA:
...eight...

72
00:03:17,519 --> 00:03:19,679
...nine, 10.

73
00:03:19,679 --> 00:03:20,880
[SNORTS]

74
00:03:20,880 --> 00:03:23,079
Ready or not,
here I come.

75
00:03:23,079 --> 00:03:25,600
[♪♪]

76
00:03:25,600 --> 00:03:29,000
Oh. George isn't hiding
under the table.

77
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:30,239
[SNORTS]

78
00:03:30,239 --> 00:03:33,280
But George always hides
under the table.

79
00:03:33,280 --> 00:03:35,840
Have you thought
of looking upstairs?

80
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:37,079
[SNORTS]

81
00:03:37,079 --> 00:03:38,959
I know where he is!

82
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:43,560
George is in
the toy basket.

83
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:46,959
[♪♪]

84
00:03:46,959 --> 00:03:48,560
Oh.

85
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:50,720
George is not
in the toy basket.

86
00:03:50,720 --> 00:03:52,560
Where can he be?

87
00:03:56,600 --> 00:03:59,119
Peppa cannot find George
anywhere.

88
00:03:59,119 --> 00:04:03,679
Daddy, I can't find
George anywhere.

89
00:04:03,679 --> 00:04:07,079
Oh, dear.
I wonder where he can be.

90
00:04:07,079 --> 00:04:09,519
[GEORGE GIGGLING]

91
00:04:11,480 --> 00:04:13,160
[SNORT]
Actually,

92
00:04:13,160 --> 00:04:16,399
I think there's something
about George in this newspaper.

93
00:04:16,399 --> 00:04:19,120
[GEORGE LAUGHING]

94
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:20,320
[GRUNTS]
Whee!

95
00:04:20,320 --> 00:04:23,599
[BLOWS RASPBERRY]
[BOTH GIGGLE]

96
00:04:23,599 --> 00:04:25,960
George! Found you!

97
00:04:25,960 --> 00:04:27,560
[LAUGHS, GRUNTS]

98
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:30,960
Oh, George, that was
a good place to hide.

99
00:04:30,960 --> 00:04:33,200
[ALL LAUGHING]

100
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:36,800
George was hiding behind Daddy
Pig's newspaper all the time.

101
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:43,440
[BLOWS RASPBERRY, GIGGLES]

102
00:04:46,840 --> 00:04:49,200
[♪♪]

103
00:04:52,159 --> 00:04:54,120
[PEPPA READING ONSCREEN TEXT]

104
00:04:57,479 --> 00:05:00,640
NARRATOR:
Peppa and George are going
to the playgroup.

105
00:05:00,640 --> 00:05:02,520
It is George's first day.

106
00:05:02,520 --> 00:05:05,400
George, are you looking
forward to the playgroup?

107
00:05:05,400 --> 00:05:06,919
[SNORTS]

108
00:05:06,919 --> 00:05:12,159
Daddy, maybe George is too small
to go to my playgroup.

109
00:05:12,159 --> 00:05:14,599
[SNORTS]
He'll be fine, Peppa.

110
00:05:14,599 --> 00:05:18,159
There'll be you and Mr. Dinosaur
there to keep him company.

111
00:05:18,159 --> 00:05:20,479
Grrr, dinosaur.

112
00:05:20,479 --> 00:05:22,039
[GIGGLES]

113
00:05:22,039 --> 00:05:24,440
But I want to play
with the big children,

114
00:05:24,440 --> 00:05:27,479
not George and his
toy dinosaur.

115
00:05:27,479 --> 00:05:31,560
Oh, dear. Peppa doesn't want
George to go to her playgroup.

116
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:35,440
[SCHOOL BELL TOLLS]

117
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:39,640
We're here.

118
00:05:39,640 --> 00:05:43,400
Daddy, are you sure
George is big enough?

119
00:05:43,400 --> 00:05:45,680
He'll be fine.

120
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:47,240
[SNORTS]

121
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:49,280
[SNORTS]
All right.

122
00:05:49,280 --> 00:05:50,599
He can come.

123
00:05:50,599 --> 00:05:51,800
[SNORTING]

124
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:53,719
[LAUGHS]
Bye-bye.

125
00:05:53,719 --> 00:05:55,039
[SNORTS]

126
00:05:56,440 --> 00:05:58,800
[ENGINE STARTS]

127
00:05:59,919 --> 00:06:02,240
[ALL LAUGHING]
Woof, woof!

128
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:05,640
Madame Gazelle looks after
the children at the playgroup.

129
00:06:05,640 --> 00:06:07,599
PEPPA [SNORTING]:
Hello!

130
00:06:07,599 --> 00:06:11,159
This is my little brother,
George.

131
00:06:11,159 --> 00:06:12,400
[KIDS LAUGH]

132
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:14,640
Hello, George.

133
00:06:14,640 --> 00:06:16,760
[ALL MAKING ANIMAL NOISES]

134
00:06:16,760 --> 00:06:18,320
[LAUGHS]

135
00:06:19,919 --> 00:06:21,200
[BLEATS]

136
00:06:21,200 --> 00:06:24,039
I wish I had a little brother
like George.

137
00:06:24,039 --> 00:06:25,479
Really?

138
00:06:25,479 --> 00:06:27,560
Hello, I'm Danny Dog.

139
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:28,799
[BARKS]

140
00:06:28,799 --> 00:06:30,440
Is that a dinosaur?

141
00:06:30,440 --> 00:06:33,080
[SNORTS]
It's just a toy dinosaur.

142
00:06:33,080 --> 00:06:35,919
Grrr, dinosaur.

143
00:06:35,919 --> 00:06:37,200
Brilliant.

144
00:06:37,200 --> 00:06:38,640
[BARKS]

145
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:41,080
Dinosaur. Grrr.

146
00:06:41,080 --> 00:06:42,320
[ALL SCREAM]

147
00:06:42,320 --> 00:06:43,840
[CHUCKLES]

148
00:06:43,840 --> 00:06:46,840
Dinosaur. Grrr.

149
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:49,599
Ah, really scary.

150
00:06:49,599 --> 00:06:51,200
[ALL LAUGH]

151
00:06:51,200 --> 00:06:53,320
That's brilliant.

152
00:06:53,320 --> 00:06:55,320
[SNORTS]
George is my brother.

153
00:06:55,320 --> 00:06:57,440
[SNORTS]
He's brilliant.

154
00:06:57,440 --> 00:06:58,919
[SNORTING]

155
00:06:58,919 --> 00:07:01,640
Peppa is proud of her
little brother George.

156
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:03,599
[CLAPS]
[KIDS GIGGLING]

157
00:07:05,280 --> 00:07:09,039
Shall we show George
how we paint pictures?

158
00:07:09,039 --> 00:07:11,919
George is not very good
at painting.

159
00:07:11,919 --> 00:07:14,039
Well, maybe you could
help him.

160
00:07:14,039 --> 00:07:16,840
[SNORTS]
Yes. I'm very good.

161
00:07:16,840 --> 00:07:19,960
I will show him
how to paint a flower.

162
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:23,560
George, today
I'm going to teach you

163
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:25,000
how to paint a flower.

164
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:26,640
[SNORTS]

165
00:07:26,640 --> 00:07:29,960
First you paint
a big circle.

166
00:07:33,400 --> 00:07:36,680
No, George,
that's the wrong color.

167
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:37,880
[SNORTS]

168
00:07:37,880 --> 00:07:40,960
Now you paint
the flower's petals.

169
00:07:42,880 --> 00:07:44,320
George!
[SNORTS]

170
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:46,039
That's the wrong shape.

171
00:07:46,039 --> 00:07:47,280
[SNORTS]

172
00:07:47,280 --> 00:07:50,520
Now you paint the stalk
and the leaves.

173
00:07:51,719 --> 00:07:54,200
[SNORTS]
Perfect.

174
00:07:57,120 --> 00:08:00,159
George, you've done it
all wrong.

175
00:08:02,159 --> 00:08:04,239
Now, what do we have here?

176
00:08:04,239 --> 00:08:06,880
[SNORTS]
I've painted a flower.

177
00:08:06,880 --> 00:08:09,120
MADAME GAZELLE:
That's very good, Peppa.

178
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:13,359
And George has painted
a dinosaur.

179
00:08:13,359 --> 00:08:16,039
Grrr. Dinosaur.

180
00:08:16,039 --> 00:08:18,120
[KIDS LAUGH]

181
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:20,719
[BARKS]
Brilliant.

182
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:26,479
I think George and Peppa's
pictures should go on the wall.

183
00:08:26,479 --> 00:08:28,599
ALL: Hooray!
[ALL LAUGH]

184
00:08:30,080 --> 00:08:34,400
Peppa, you must be very proud
of your little brother.

185
00:08:34,400 --> 00:08:37,280
[SNORTS]
Yes, I am.

186
00:08:37,280 --> 00:08:39,360
[MAKING ANIMAL NOISES]

187
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:41,799
It is home time,
and the children's parents

188
00:08:41,799 --> 00:08:43,880
are here to pick them up.

189
00:08:43,880 --> 00:08:46,480
[SNORTS]
Can George come next time?

190
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:50,959
Yes. And he can paint us
another lovely picture.

191
00:08:50,959 --> 00:08:54,280
And what will you paint
next time, George?

192
00:08:54,280 --> 00:08:56,520
Dinosaur. Grrr.

193
00:08:56,520 --> 00:08:59,560
Oh! Another dinosaur
picture?

194
00:08:59,560 --> 00:09:03,000
Well, maybe you can show us all
how to paint a dinosaur.

195
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,079
[SNORTS]

196
00:09:04,079 --> 00:09:06,240
[BARKS]
Brilliant.

197
00:09:06,240 --> 00:09:08,959
Yes. Brilliant.

198
00:09:08,959 --> 00:09:10,880
[SNORTS]
Brilliant.

199
00:09:10,880 --> 00:09:13,280
[ALL LAUGH]

200
00:09:17,920 --> 00:09:19,680
[BIRDS TWEETING]

201
00:09:19,680 --> 00:09:22,000
[♪♪]

202
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,800
[PEPPA READING ONSCREEN TEXT]

203
00:09:23,800 --> 00:09:26,000
[KEYBOARD CLACKING]

204
00:09:29,959 --> 00:09:32,760
NARRATOR:
Mommy Pig is working
on her computer.

205
00:09:32,760 --> 00:09:37,280
[♪♪]

206
00:09:37,280 --> 00:09:41,439
Daddy Pig is making soup
for lunch.

207
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:44,680
[SNORTS]
Daddy?

208
00:09:44,680 --> 00:09:47,280
Can we go and watch
Mommy on her computer?

209
00:09:47,280 --> 00:09:50,319
Yes, as long as
you don't disturb her.

210
00:09:50,319 --> 00:09:52,760
She has a lot of important
work to do today.

211
00:09:52,760 --> 00:09:54,280
[SNORTS]
Thank you, Daddy!

212
00:09:54,280 --> 00:09:56,240
[SNORTS]
[BOTH LAUGH]

213
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:58,040
[KEYBOARD CLACKING]

214
00:09:58,040 --> 00:10:00,640
Mommy Pig has a lot
of important work to do.

215
00:10:03,760 --> 00:10:05,040
[SNORTS]
Mommy.

216
00:10:05,040 --> 00:10:07,360
Can George and I
sit on your lap

217
00:10:07,360 --> 00:10:08,760
and watch you work?

218
00:10:08,760 --> 00:10:11,199
Yes. If you both
sit quietly.

219
00:10:11,199 --> 00:10:13,920
[BOTH GIGGLE]

220
00:10:13,920 --> 00:10:17,199
Peppa and George love to watch
Mommy work on the computer.

221
00:10:19,520 --> 00:10:22,000
Mommy? Can we play
that computer game,

222
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:24,199
"Happy Mrs. Chicken?"
[SNORTS]

223
00:10:24,199 --> 00:10:26,680
We can play,
"Happy Mrs. Chicken" later.

224
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:28,920
But now I have to work.

225
00:10:28,920 --> 00:10:31,920
Mommy, can we
help you work?

226
00:10:31,920 --> 00:10:34,839
No, Peppa. You mustn't
touch the computer.

227
00:10:34,839 --> 00:10:36,319
[SNORTS]
And George,

228
00:10:36,319 --> 00:10:38,640
you mustn't touch
the computer either.

229
00:10:38,640 --> 00:10:41,800
Yes, George.
You mustn't do this.

230
00:10:43,680 --> 00:10:45,640
Peppa, stop!

231
00:10:45,640 --> 00:10:47,120
[SNORTS]
Sorry, Mommy.

232
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:50,600
I was just showing George
what not to do.

233
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:53,520
[COMPUTER BEEPING]

234
00:10:53,520 --> 00:10:56,839
Oh, dear. The computer
is not meant to do that.

235
00:10:56,839 --> 00:10:58,160
Daddy Pig!

236
00:10:59,439 --> 00:11:01,240
Daddy Pig!

237
00:11:01,240 --> 00:11:03,199
What is it, Mommy Pig?

238
00:11:03,199 --> 00:11:05,839
[BEEPING]

239
00:11:05,839 --> 00:11:07,120
Daddy Pig.
[SNORTS]

240
00:11:07,120 --> 00:11:08,520
Can you mend the computer?

241
00:11:08,520 --> 00:11:10,079
Um...

242
00:11:10,079 --> 00:11:13,199
I'll finish the lunch,
while you mend the computer.

243
00:11:13,199 --> 00:11:15,839
Uh...right you are,
Mommy Pig.

244
00:11:15,839 --> 00:11:18,319
But I'm not very good
with these things.

245
00:11:18,319 --> 00:11:20,920
Oh, thank you,
Daddy Pig.

246
00:11:20,920 --> 00:11:23,400
Daddy Pig is going
to mend the computer.

247
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:26,000
Hmm.

248
00:11:28,520 --> 00:11:29,719
[BEEPING]

249
00:11:29,719 --> 00:11:31,719
Hmm.

250
00:11:33,719 --> 00:11:36,079
Hmm.

251
00:11:36,079 --> 00:11:39,240
Um, maybe if I just
switch it off...

252
00:11:40,520 --> 00:11:42,079
and then switch it on again.

253
00:11:45,480 --> 00:11:48,000
Daddy Pig has mended
the computer.

254
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:50,079
Hooray, Daddy!
[SNORTS]

255
00:11:50,079 --> 00:11:52,000
[BOTH LAUGH]

256
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:54,480
Yes, I am a bit of an expert
at these things.

257
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:55,640
[SNORTS]

258
00:11:55,640 --> 00:11:57,839
Daddy?
[SNORTS]

259
00:11:57,839 --> 00:12:01,640
Can we play that computer game,
"Happy Mrs. Chicken?"

260
00:12:01,640 --> 00:12:03,680
Maybe you should ask
Mommy Pig.

261
00:12:03,680 --> 00:12:06,560
Mommy said that we can
play it later.

262
00:12:06,560 --> 00:12:07,959
Well, that's okay, then.

263
00:12:07,959 --> 00:12:10,719
But I don't know
where the disc is.

264
00:12:10,719 --> 00:12:12,199
[SNORTS]

265
00:12:15,400 --> 00:12:16,839
[SNORTING]

266
00:12:21,640 --> 00:12:23,800
[CHICKEN CLUCKS]

267
00:12:24,719 --> 00:12:27,079
[CLUCKING]

268
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:31,719
Yippee!
[SNORTS]

269
00:12:31,719 --> 00:12:34,680
[SNORTING]
[CHUCKLES]

270
00:12:34,680 --> 00:12:37,199
[♪♪]

271
00:12:37,199 --> 00:12:40,079
[CLUCKS, PASSES GAS]

272
00:12:40,079 --> 00:12:41,839
[ALL LAUGH]

273
00:12:41,839 --> 00:12:43,839
Now it's my turn.

274
00:12:43,839 --> 00:12:46,000
[♪♪]

275
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:48,079
[CLUCKS, PASSES GAS]

276
00:12:48,079 --> 00:12:49,520
[CLUCKS, PASSES GAS]

277
00:12:49,520 --> 00:12:52,439
[ALL GIGGLING]

278
00:12:52,439 --> 00:12:53,839
[LAUGHS]

279
00:12:53,839 --> 00:12:55,280
Now it's my turn.

280
00:12:55,280 --> 00:12:56,920
[KEYBOARD CLACKING]

281
00:12:56,920 --> 00:12:59,400
[♪♪]

282
00:12:59,400 --> 00:13:02,000
[CLUCKING, PASSING GAS]

283
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:04,920
[ALL LAUGHING]

284
00:13:10,480 --> 00:13:13,560
[SNORTS]
What on earth is going on?

285
00:13:13,560 --> 00:13:15,640
[ALL LAUGHING]

286
00:13:21,280 --> 00:13:23,199
[SNORTS]
[CLUCKS, PASSES GAS]

287
00:13:23,199 --> 00:13:26,439
Well, I see the computer
is working again.

288
00:13:28,199 --> 00:13:29,480
[CHICKS CLUCKING]

289
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:31,439
[LAUGHS, SNORTS]

290
00:13:31,439 --> 00:13:33,360
[ALL LAUGHING]

291
00:13:35,439 --> 00:13:38,199
[ALL CLUCKING]

292
00:13:38,199 --> 00:13:40,040
[ALL PASSING GAS]

293
00:13:48,839 --> 00:13:51,839
[♪♪]

294
00:13:54,360 --> 00:13:56,120
[PEPPA READS ONSCREEN TEXT]

295
00:13:59,560 --> 00:14:02,480
[GIGGLING, GRUNTS]

296
00:14:02,480 --> 00:14:05,640
NARRATOR:
George is playing with his ball
in the garden.

297
00:14:05,640 --> 00:14:07,199
[SNORTS]

298
00:14:13,319 --> 00:14:15,599
Peppa wants to play too.

299
00:14:15,599 --> 00:14:18,199
George, you're doing it
all wrong!

300
00:14:20,880 --> 00:14:23,199
This is how
to catch a ball.

301
00:14:23,199 --> 00:14:24,560
[SNORTS]

302
00:14:28,280 --> 00:14:31,319
Not like this.
[SNORTS LOUDLY]

303
00:14:33,839 --> 00:14:35,400
[GIGGLING]

304
00:14:37,199 --> 00:14:39,040
That's what you do.

305
00:14:39,040 --> 00:14:41,599
What a cheeky little one
Peppa is.

306
00:14:42,920 --> 00:14:44,240
[SNORTS, LAUGHS]

307
00:14:44,240 --> 00:14:47,520
George, come back,
you little piggy.

308
00:14:47,520 --> 00:14:49,360
[BOTH LAUGHING]

309
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:54,920
[BIRDS CHIRPING]

310
00:15:01,160 --> 00:15:04,360
[LAUGHS]

311
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:07,599
Maybe Peppa is teasing George
just a bit too much.

312
00:15:08,719 --> 00:15:11,839
Peppa, have you been
teasing George?

313
00:15:11,839 --> 00:15:14,760
Not really, Mommy.
I was teaching him how to catch.

314
00:15:14,760 --> 00:15:16,439
MOMMY PIG:
Really?

315
00:15:16,439 --> 00:15:19,439
Oh, well, I know a game that
will teach George how to catch.

316
00:15:19,439 --> 00:15:21,640
It's called
piggy in the middle.

317
00:15:21,640 --> 00:15:23,839
[BOTH LAUGH]

318
00:15:23,839 --> 00:15:26,439
Peppa, you take the ball
and stand over there.

319
00:15:26,439 --> 00:15:29,479
And, George,
you stand over there.

320
00:15:29,479 --> 00:15:30,760
Good.

321
00:15:30,760 --> 00:15:32,920
You have to throw the ball
to each other,

322
00:15:32,920 --> 00:15:34,880
and I have to try
and catch it.

323
00:15:34,880 --> 00:15:36,520
I'm the piggy
in the middle.

324
00:15:36,520 --> 00:15:37,839
[GIGGLES]

325
00:15:37,839 --> 00:15:40,240
♪ Mommy is the
Piggy in the middle ♪

326
00:15:40,240 --> 00:15:42,800
[PEPPA AND GEORGE LAUGH]

327
00:15:42,800 --> 00:15:44,400
Catch, George.

328
00:15:44,400 --> 00:15:46,000
Oh. Missed it.

329
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:47,199
[SNORTS]

330
00:15:47,199 --> 00:15:48,719
George has caught the ball.

331
00:15:48,719 --> 00:15:50,000
Hooray!
Hooray!

332
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:51,240
[BOTH LAUGH]

333
00:15:51,240 --> 00:15:52,400
Well done, George.

334
00:15:52,400 --> 00:15:54,319
Now you throw the ball
to Peppa.

335
00:15:56,199 --> 00:15:57,640
Oop, try again.

336
00:15:59,439 --> 00:16:01,400
Oh, try again.

337
00:16:04,040 --> 00:16:07,040
George cannot throw the ball
past Mommy Pig.

338
00:16:07,040 --> 00:16:09,400
Come on, George,
give the ball to me.

339
00:16:09,400 --> 00:16:11,319
[SNORTS]

340
00:16:12,319 --> 00:16:14,439
Oh!
[ALL LAUGH]

341
00:16:15,479 --> 00:16:17,160
[SNORTS]
Silly George.

342
00:16:17,160 --> 00:16:18,400
[GIGGLES]

343
00:16:18,400 --> 00:16:20,520
I can do that too.

344
00:16:20,520 --> 00:16:22,040
[LAUGHING]
Oh!

345
00:16:22,040 --> 00:16:23,199
[SNORTS]

346
00:16:23,199 --> 00:16:24,800
Peppa wanted
to copy George,

347
00:16:24,800 --> 00:16:27,959
but she's too big
and has got stuck.

348
00:16:30,760 --> 00:16:31,959
[SNORTS AND CHUCKLES]

349
00:16:31,959 --> 00:16:33,280
I've got the ball.

350
00:16:33,280 --> 00:16:35,839
Peppa, now it's your turn
to be piggy.

351
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:39,839
George, catch.

352
00:16:39,839 --> 00:16:42,520
[SNORTS]
MOMMY PIG &amp; PEPPA: Hooray!

353
00:16:43,520 --> 00:16:44,839
Caught it!

354
00:16:44,839 --> 00:16:46,920
George, you're the piggy.

355
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:48,280
[GIGGLES]

356
00:16:48,280 --> 00:16:50,520
George, catch!

357
00:16:50,520 --> 00:16:51,800
[ALL LAUGH]

358
00:16:51,800 --> 00:16:53,400
Catch the ball,
George.

359
00:16:53,400 --> 00:16:55,040
[ALL LAUGHING]

360
00:16:55,040 --> 00:16:57,199
[SNORTS]
Catch, George!

361
00:16:57,199 --> 00:16:59,719
George, catch.

362
00:16:59,719 --> 00:17:01,959
[GIGGLES AND SNORTS]

363
00:17:01,959 --> 00:17:04,399
Here's the ball,
George.

364
00:17:05,760 --> 00:17:07,919
[GIGGLES AND SNORTS]

365
00:17:07,919 --> 00:17:10,079
Wee!

366
00:17:10,079 --> 00:17:11,319
[CRIES]

367
00:17:11,319 --> 00:17:13,359
MOMMY PIG:
Oh, dear.

368
00:17:13,359 --> 00:17:16,520
Peppa, you shouldn't
tease George like that.

369
00:17:16,520 --> 00:17:19,119
[WHIMPERING]
Sorry, George.

370
00:17:20,280 --> 00:17:23,119
What's all the noise?

371
00:17:23,119 --> 00:17:26,960
Daddy, George is too little
to play piggy in the middle.

372
00:17:26,960 --> 00:17:29,520
Oh, I'm sure
he's big enough.

373
00:17:29,520 --> 00:17:33,080
No, he isn't, Daddy.
Watch.

374
00:17:33,080 --> 00:17:34,919
Catch it, George.

375
00:17:34,919 --> 00:17:36,280
Hooray!

376
00:17:36,280 --> 00:17:38,520
[ALL LAUGH]

377
00:17:38,520 --> 00:17:40,720
[SNORTS]
That's not fair!

378
00:17:40,720 --> 00:17:44,240
Yes, it is. I just gave George
a helping hand.

379
00:17:44,240 --> 00:17:46,520
[ALL LAUGHING]

380
00:17:46,520 --> 00:17:49,399
Mommy, can I have
a helping hand?

381
00:17:49,399 --> 00:17:52,360
Of course you can, Peppa.

382
00:17:52,360 --> 00:17:54,520
[GIGGLES AND SNORTS]

383
00:17:56,680 --> 00:17:58,320
To me, George!

384
00:17:59,800 --> 00:18:01,159
Catch, George.

385
00:18:01,159 --> 00:18:03,040
[LAUGHS]

386
00:18:03,040 --> 00:18:05,680
Peppa loves
catching the ball.

387
00:18:05,680 --> 00:18:07,960
George loves catching
the ball.

388
00:18:07,960 --> 00:18:09,960
Everyone loves
catching the ball.

389
00:18:09,960 --> 00:18:12,399
[ALL LAUGHING AND SNORTING

390
00:18:19,840 --> 00:18:21,120
[♪♪]

391
00:18:21,120 --> 00:18:22,440
[GIGGLING AND SNORTING]

392
00:18:22,440 --> 00:18:23,879
♪ Peppa Pig ♪

393
00:18:23,879 --> 00:18:26,919
[GIGGLING AND SNORTING]

394
00:18:26,919 --> 00:18:28,840
♪ Peppa Pig ♪

395
00:18:28,840 --> 00:18:31,200
